     "titulo": "Because, although and so",
     "texto": [
      "**因为…所以…** expresses a cause and its result: «because… so…». **虽然…但是…** presents a difficulty and then what happens despite it: «although… but…».",
      "**意思** means «meaning»; in **有意思** it means «interesting», so the context changes the translation."
     ],
